    - rid: 1123138610053513249
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Beneath the table
        text: Something knocks beneath the table. He presses a hand against it.
        continueLabel: Wait for him to explain
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513250
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: What it wants
        text: It likes watching us play. Likes cheating more. Beat me despite its meddling, and it sulks for a while. Long enough for me to show you the way.
        continueLabel: Ask how to stop it
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513251
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: A short candle
        text: He takes a short candle from beside a wooden chest.
        continueLabel: Watch the flame
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
